---
title: Ordering
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant W as Web app
    participant A as API<br>gateway
    participant Bank
    C->>W: Place order
    W->>+A: POST /orders
    A->>Bank: Authorise payment
    Bank-->>A: Approved
    Note over A,Bank: One order, one transaction
    A-->>-W: 201 Created
    Note right of W: Shows the receipt
    W-->>C: Order confirmed
    Note left of C: Happy
    C->>C: Thinks
